    "detail": "This hotel was fine, the room was nice, and the staff did all I asked them to do and was needed efficiently Some of the other reviews have been a bit hard on Moonlight Hotel. There are more upmarket places in Da Nang, but they are going to cost more too. So take the price, location and what the hotel has on offer I think this is a good all round option My room and bathroom were of a good size, nicely cleaned and well presented. The shower was great Breakfast was squarely aimed that there Asian costumers, but there was still more than enough on offer for Western guests too",
